	(descr "Hong Cheng HC-PM254-8.5H series 2.54mm female socket strip, 1x22, through-hole vertical, H=8.5mm. Authored from the manufacturer drawing CS-1165SDIG-1x22: pitch 2.54, pin span 53.34 (21 pitches, the drawing's B for 1*22), housing 56.28 long (A+0.4, A=55.88) x 2.40 wide, pin 0.64x0.40, recommended PCB hole dia 1.02. Origin is pin 1 and the row runs +Y, so the pad coordinates are directly comparable with the library's other 2.54mm socket rows. THE DRAWING DISTINGUISHES NO POSITION - all 22 housing cavities and all 22 recommended holes are drawn alike - so the rect pad 1, the F.Fab corner chamfer and the F.SilkS tick are this library's pin-1 marking, not the vendor's. The 1.70 annulus is the library land for 2.54mm THT sockets; the drawing states only the hole.")
